// FROZEN 2026-09-13 (user), at the same time as CRITERIA.md -- a frozen criterion
// against an unfrozen config means nothing, which is what this line used to say was
// still outstanding. From here the VALUES are not changed; a change goes through
// CRITERIA.md's revision record and says which data it was made after.
//
// One key was ADDED at freezing rather than changed: spectral_rank_modes = 4. The field
// did not exist when this file was written, and benchmarks/README.md requires this file
// to be the COMPLETE SearchConfig dict -- leaving it out would have frozen a record that
// silently omits the knob deciding which directions the budget is spent on. It is at its
// default, and its justification is a measurement (config.RATIONALE, and
// docs/experiments/spectral_proposal_probe.py: on this very grid the direction that
// reacted ranks 1 of 28 under it, at overlap 0.9651 against 0.6893 for the next).
//
// probe1-4 all predate this freeze. They are probes, not acceptance runs, and freezing
// does not retroactively make them one.
//
// ~~"the configuration b04 would run with once the three gaps in README.md are
// closed"~~ -- that line is retracted (2026-09-09). The three gaps ARE closed and this
// file has run three times: runs/b04_probe, runs/b04_probe2_openceiling and
// runs/b04_probe3_rigidbond. It is no longer a hypothetical; it is the record of how
// b04 was searched, and the two edits at the bottom of this header exist to stop it
// contradicting that record.
//
// closed_shell_only: RETRACTED 2026-09-04. This file used to say the flag must stay
// True because "a benchmark may not switch the domain gate off". That was written in a
// MACE-OFF24 context. The gate's own stated reason (network.py, Registry.admit) is that
// MACE-OFF is trained on neutral closed-shell molecules and does not respond to total
// charge at all -- a property of THAT model. POLAR-1's charge response is measured at
// 16.67 eV across charge 0/-1/+1, so the reason does not apply and False is the correct
// setting for it, as a declared model property rather than a workaround. What still
// guards the domain for POLAR-1 is element coverage (preflight gate 5) and, when a
// committee is available, force disagreement.
//
// Making chemistry.VALENCE charge-aware is still worth doing -- it would make the gate
// MEAN something for anions instead of being switched off -- but it no longer blocks b04.
// 2026-09-09，队列第 2 项（用户裁决）：这份文件对齐**实际被接受的那次运行**，
// 不再让冻结文本与历史事实相左。两处改动，各自的理由不同：
//
// direction_mode = "sampled" —— **这是 probe1/2/3 的历史事实，不得追认成 exhaustive。**
//   三次探针都在缺省的抽样预算下跑的，基覆盖 14/28 = 50%（`cap_bound false`，
//   截断者是 direction_quota_fraction）。把它写出来是为了让每一条负结论都带着
//   它该带的限定：`sampled` 下的 null 一律 `unanswered`，见 CRITERIA.md。
//
// saddle_search_max_rise_eV: 1.5 -> 10.0 —— 对齐实际接受的运行。1.5 **已知会在
//   step 0 拒绝种子**（实测 max_rise 1.5479 与 1.6821 两个种子都在它之上），
//   所以原样冻结等于冻结一个已证明失效的值。
//
//   **10.0 是非 binding 的探针包络，不是最终生产上限。** 它的作用是"别挡路"，
//   而真正的上限按 DECISIONS_PENDING 4a 是 B 组跑完之后的**输出**：现有数据点 n = 2，
//   且实测显示种子质量与能量高低**不同向**（重叠 0.986 的那个种子 max_rise 反而更高）。
//   **4a 日后冻结那个值时不回写这份历史配置** —— 这份文件记的是 b04 怎么跑的，
//   不是生产默认值该是多少。

